user_reviews.Description:
one of the nicest places i have been into in a long time; wife and i had a great dining experience here;
beautiful place, dont let "coffee shop" fool you; it has a 6 page food menu ( only 2 in english);
even tho it is right on the ultra-busy road, there isnt much road noise inside ( cant imagine why people coming here would sit outside);
good+ coffee, has pastries,
front door still says "open everyday" but the manager told us they were now closing on sundays;
prices and portions are ok quite , meaning good value; food quality was quite high;
friendly staff; good parking (hard to find in this area);
that is vital because this was far and away the best place in this area of the city that we visited;
we WILL return ( we live a 5 hour drive away) ;
this is the kind of place you budget maybe 30 minutes and stay an hour and a half; interesting interior;

the visit here was one of or the the top highlight of our trip

